Keep OHOS EGL orientation and negotiate native window color spaces.

The EGL color-space hook preserves the upstream default on other platforms.
OHOS validates and allocates P3/PQ surfaces before publishing their capability;
the GL output device wraps the actual default framebuffer during bootstrap.

